{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":23.329999923706055,"text":"Two boys stand facing each other, each with a glove on one hand and the other hand bare. Their heads are shaved with long locks left to hang down, the way children wore their hair then, and one of them is wearing jewelry. It is one of very few ancient works showing children doing sport, and it was painted about three and a half thousand years ago on the wall of a house in Akrotiri.","words":[{"word":"Two","start":0,"end":0.6200000047683716},{"word":"boys","start":0.6200000047683716,"end":0.8999999761581421},{"word":"stand","start":0.8999999761581421,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"facing","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"each","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":2},{"word":"other","start":2,"end":2.2200000286102295},{"word":"each","start":2.799999952316284,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"with","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"a","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"glove","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.4000000953674316},{"word":"on","start":3.4000000953674316,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"one","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"hand","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.199999809265137},{"word":"and","start":4.199999809265137,"end":4.460000038146973},{"word":"the","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.679999828338623},{"word":"other","start":4.679999828338623,"end":4.820000171661377},{"word":"hand","start":4.820000171661377,"end":5.380000114440918},{"word":"bare","start":5.380000114440918,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"Their","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.380000114440918},{"word":"heads","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.599999904632568},{"word":"are","start":6.599999904632568,"end":7.199999809265137},{"word":"shaved","start":7.199999809265137,"end":7.199999809265137},{"word":"with","start":7.199999809265137,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":"long","start":7.460000038146973